# AppBar Source of Truth

When implementing pages from `.cursor/design-html/*` design references:

- **Always keep the current shared app bar** (`PortalHeader` / shared header component).
- **Ignore** any header/nav markup in the design HTML files.
- Only use the design ref for page content below the app bar (body, boards, dialogs, side panels, etc.).
- Wire new pages into the existing app bar nav links instead of cloning a new header from the mock.
